+  #
+  # A row keeps its own account_id when that points at a real account. Otherwise
+  # it takes the account of its owner: the parent its model copies `account` from.
+  # Rows that still resolve to no account are deleted, as are join rows whose
+  # required counterpart (user, tag, event) no longer exists.
